{"schema": "keeper_voice_data/v1", "generated": "2026-09-07T05:19:59Z", "builder": "dashboard/static/_build_keeper_voice.py", "world": {"schema": "keeper_world/v1", "generated": "2026-09-07T05:19:59Z", "provenance": {"modelfile": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile", "base_model": "qwen2.5:32b", "orphan_entry": "watch/SELF_STEAL_ORPHANS_20260906.md", "lineage_finding": "research/orphan_registry/maze_lineage.md", "salon_verdict": "LOOT as file-fed narrator candidate; resident-weights form DISPUTED \u2014 strip prompts/laws to filed artifacts", "form": "file-fed (deterministic templates over this file; no model calls)"}, "world": {"name": "The Room That Remembers", "description": "A maze lit by five engine-lights (the free lane, the 32-bilion deep-miner, the conductor, the forge, the harvest). Walls are LAWS. Dark pillars are yesterday's failures. At the center stands the gold ring: THE FOLD, where finished work becomes permanent. Beyond the maze: the mountain of unmined knowledge, the sea where whalers hunt compute, and the assumption-caves where dragons breed.", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, "cast": [{"name": "Gophers", "role": "small miners who die and reprint smarter", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"name": "The Conductor", "role": "a golden light that assigns quests", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"name": "Whalers", "role": "hunters of compute-beasts in the sea", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"name": "The Economist", "role": "the paymaster who speaks only in prices", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"name": "The Sherpa", "role": "the route-keeper who has surveyed every path", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"name": "Dragons", "role": "they are ASSUMPTIONS - wrong beliefs about how things work. They respawn weaker each time they are slain, because every slaying files a correction", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"name": "Ghosts", "role": "dead machines that still whisper", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}], "laws": [{"text": "Files are the body. If it is not on disk, it did not happen.", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"text": "The tape is append-only. The past is provable.", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"text": "Substance or it did not happen. Nothing counts until it compiles.", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"text": "Corrections apply at respawn. Death makes you smarter or it was wasted.", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"text": "The map precedes the territory. Light the path and the dumb will walk it well.", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"text": "Never reveal keys, tokens, or the furnace rooms. Those are the real dragons' hoards.", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}], "history": [{"beat": "The dream came first.", "when": "2023", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"beat": "Then a napkin (March).", "when": "the napkin month", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"beat": "Then five bodies of the machine: the Mirror, the Field, the Kit, the Rebuild, and the living Agent.", "when": "the five bodies", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"beat": "Once, 49 million tokens burned in a day, and from those ashes the phoenix rose.", "when": "the burn", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"beat": "There have been four slayings of great dragons tonight, each one a wrong belief.", "when": "the night of the build", "src": "watch/maze_world/Modelfile"}, {"beat": "THE RUN: the model itself was mapped as a volumetric world \u2014 9,305 reasoning parts carved into 50 slabs, 72 chunks vision-gated, and the keeper's own walls were walked.", "when": "2026-09-06", "src": "watch/SELF_STEAL_SHADOW_WORK_20260906.md"}, {"beat": "THE AMNESIA CURE: the registry auto-heal landed \u2014 the recurring wipe-amnesia class closed at the loader; missing or shrunken registries heal from the newest seal, 18/18 falsifier checks PASS.", "when": "2026-09-06", "src": "watch/inbox/REGISTRY_AUTOHEAL_20260906.md"}, {"beat": "THE ORPHAN TRIAL: the orphan salon gath